  "worked_solution": "The area of the region is given by\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{0}(6{cos}^{2}\u2061(2x)-6{sin}^{2}\u2061(2x)+3x+17)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTo calculate this integral, we use the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}\u20612x={cos}^{2}\u2061x-{sin}^{2}\u2061x\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite the above formula as\n\n$$\n6\\operatorname{cos}\u20614x=6{cos}^{2}\u2061(2x)-6{sin}^{2}\u2061(2x).\n$$\n\nHence, the area of the region is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{0}(6{cos}^{2}\u2061(2x)-6{sin}^{2}\u2061(2x)+3x+17)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{0}(6\\operatorname{cos}\u20614x+3x+17)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sin}\u20614x+\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{2}+17x)\\,{|}_{-\\pi /2}^{0} \\\\  & =[\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(0)+\\frac{3}{2}(0)^{2}+17\\cdot 0]-[\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(-2\\pi )+\\frac{3}{2}{(-\\frac{\\pi }{2})}^{2}+17(-\\frac{\\pi }{2})] \\\\  & =[0+0+0]-[0+\\frac{3{\\pi }^{2}}{8}-\\frac{17\\pi }{2}] \\\\  & =[0+\\frac{17\\pi }{2}-\\frac{3{\\pi }^{2}}{8}]-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{17\\pi }{2}-\\frac{3{\\pi }^{2}}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
